    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Cause and consequence",
     "texto": [
      "**Karena** introduces the cause; **akibatnya** and **sehingga** present a result. Compare benefits and limits before recommending a solution.",
      "In English, \"because\" goes before the cause and \"as a result\" before the result. In Indonesian, **karena** usually goes before the cause and **akibatnya** before the result."
     ],
